    enum ParserState {
        // ... existing states ...
        PARSING_HEADERS,
        PARSING_BODY,
        PARSING_WAITING_FOR_DATA, // New state
        PARSING_COMPLETE,
        PARSING_ERROR
    };
    // ...
}
```

**2. Add a member to your `Connection` struct/class to remember the state before waiting:**

```cpp
