// Ensure they correctly return:
// - A specific success status (e.g., PARSE_SUCCESS or PARSE_HEADERS_COMPLETE)
// - PARSE_INCOMPLETE if more data is needed for the *current line/part* they are parsing.
// - An error code if an error occurs (and set conn->parser_state_ = codes::PARSING_ERROR).
